
/* ================================================================
   BAILEY + EDEN LAKE ENCOUNTER
   A chance scene at the Lake Shore. Can fire when Eden's route is
   active ($syndromeeden >= 1), Stockholm >= 1, the time is 11:00–13:59,
   and a 20% roll passes ($rng >= 81). Capped at once a week by
   $weekly.baileyEdenLake.
   ================================================================ */
:: Bailey Eden Lake
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<if !$baileySeen?.includes("edenLakeSeen")>>
	You see two figures at the water's edge.
	<br><br>

	<span class="bailey-red">It's Bailey.</span> And Eden.
	<br><br>

	They're sitting on a fallen log at the far end of the lake, where the trees hang low over the water. They're both holding fishing rods.
	<br><br>

	Neither is talking. Eden stares at <<nnpc_his "Eden">> line. Bailey reels in a catch. <<He>> unhooks it without looking and drops it in a freezer. Eden's jaw tightens.
	<br><br>

	Bailey casts again. The line hits the water, causing lotus flowers to drift away. <<if $bailey_lure_received>><span class="blue">You recognize Bailey's lure.</span> It's the snake-shaped fishing lure you gave <<him>> for Christmas.<</if>>
	<br><br>


	<<if $renttime lte 0>>
		<span class="red">Rent is due.</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You see two figures at the water's edge.
	<br><br>

	<span class="bailey-red">It's Bailey.</span> And Eden.
	<br><br>

	They're here again, sitting on the same log and holding the same fishing rods.
	<br><br>

	Eden seems to be struggling to catch anything while Bailey reels a catch in leisurely.
	<br><br>

	<<if $renttime lte 0>>
		<span class="red">Rent is due.</span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<baileySeenAdd "edenLakeSeen">>

<<link [[Approach|Bailey Eden Lake Approach]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Watch|Bailey Eden Lake Watch]]>><</link>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 600>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Bailey Eden Lake Leave]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Leave
<<effects>>

You step back into the trees and leave before they can spot you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Lake Shore]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Watch
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You crouch behind a tree and hide. The bark feels rough against your palms.
<br><br>

<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 600>>
<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<skulduggeryuse>>

	You wait and watch. Minutes pass. <<pass 10>>
	<br><br>

	Eden reels in nothing and casts again. Bailey reels in a fish and drops it in the freezer. <<His>> pile of catches grows higher. Eden's knuckles whiten on <<nnpc_his "Eden">> rod.
	<br><br>

	<<if $bailey_dom gte C.npc.Eden.dom>>
		Bailey says something you can't hear. Eden hesitates for a moment before nodding once.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Eden casts again. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> reels in a fish immediately with a look of triumph. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> drops the fish into the freezer between them. It seems to be the only fish <<nnpc_he "Eden">> caught so far.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	Eden reaches into <<nnpc_his "Eden">> jacket and pulls out a creased envelope. Bailey is unhooking another catch when the envelope is set on the log between them. <<He>> drops the fish into the freezer and closes it before reaching for the envelope.
	<br><br>

	Eden stands. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> picks up <<nnpc_his "Eden">> rifle and takes the freezer with <<nnpc_him "Eden">>. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> looks at the lake one more time, almost making eye contact with you. Then, <<nnpc_he "Eden">> gives Bailey a nod and walks into the forest.
	<br><br>

	Bailey doesn't watch <<nnpc_him "Eden">> go. <<He>> tucks the envelope into <<his>> jacket and casts <<his>> line again.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Approach Bailey|Bailey Eden Lake Approach Solo]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave quietly|Bailey Eden Lake Watch Leave]]>><</link>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Something snaps under your feet.</span> Both heads turn.<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 4 or effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 4 or effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 4>> Your <<= effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 4 ? "wolf" : (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 4 ? "cat" : "fox")>> ears flatten. Too late.<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 4>> Your feathers ruffle. Too late.<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 4>> Your cow ears twitch. Too late.<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("waterdragon") gte 4>> Your dragon ears twitch. Too late.<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Eden's hand finds <<nnpc_his "Eden">> rifle. Bailey turns back to reeling in <<his>> rod.
	<br><br>

	<<if $renttime lte 0>>
		<<link [[Next|Bailey Eden Lake Caught]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Bailey Eden Lake Confrontation]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Watch Leave
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You start to leave. The trees are right behind you, just a few steps away.
<br><br>

<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<span class="green">You reach the trees.</span>
	<br><br>

	Bailey's line lands in the water. The lotus flowers drift apart and close again behind the lure.
	<br><br>

	You leave.
	<<skulduggeryuse>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Lake Shore]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You take a step towards the trees.</span>
	<br><br>

	"I know you're there."
	<br><br>

	Bailey hasn't turned to look at you. <<His>> line is still in the water. <<He>> reels it in, slowly, and sets the rod down.
	<br><br>

	<<if $renttime lte 0>>
		<<link [[Next|Bailey Eden Lake Solo Rent]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Bailey Eden Lake Solo Talk]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Solo Rent
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

Bailey stands. <<He>> shoulders the rod.
<br><br>

"Convenient." <<He>> walks towards you. "Saves me a trip."
<br><br>

<<He>> holds out <<his>> hand. "Pay up."
<br><br>

<<if $money gte $rentmoney>>
	<<link [[Pay|Bailey Eden Lake Solo Pay]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 1 and $money gte $rentmoney>>
	<span class="red bailey-stockholm"><<link [[Offer yourself|Bailey Eden Lake Solo Offer]]>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Refuse|Bailey Eden Lake Solo Refuse]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Solo Pay
<<effects>><<pass 5>>
<<person1>>

You hand over the money. Bailey counts it before folding it into <<his>> jacket.
<br><br>

<<set $money -= $rentmoney>><<set $renttime to 7>>

"Good." <<He>> nods towards the tree line. "Go home."
<br><br>

<<He>> walks into the trees without looking back, rod over <<his>> shoulder.
<br><br>

You're alone at the lake. Lotus flowers drift across the surface.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Lake Shore]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Solo Offer
<<effects>><<pass 10>>
<<person1>>

/* PC has the rent money but offers to be sold anyway. Meek / bratty / neutral wording. */
<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy")>>
	"I-I have the money," you say quietly. You hold it out, then pull it back slightly. "But I could... go. If you wanted. I-I'll be back."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I have your money," you say, holding the money out. "But you can send me. I'll just be right back, anyway."
<<else>>
	"I have the money," you say, holding the money out. "But I'll go willingly, if that's worth more to you. I'll be back."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey looks between you and the trees where Eden left. <<He>> takes the money from you.<<set $money -= $rentmoney>>
<br><br>

"Wait here."
<br><br>

<<He>> turns from you and walks a few steps towards the forest. You hear a whistle made up of two sharp notes. A minute passes. Then, you hear heavy footsteps approaching.
<br><br>

Eden comes back through the trees. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> is carrying the freezer in one hand and <<nnpc_his "Eden">> rifle in the other. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> stops when <<nnpc_he "Eden">> sees you.
<br><br>

Bailey is counting the money. "Take this one too."<<if $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 0>><</if>><<if $bailey_offered is 0>><<set $bailey_dom += 3>><<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<set $bailey_love += 3>><<glove "Bailey">><<set $stockholm_bailey += 1>><<gbaileystock>><<else>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">><</if>><<set $bailey_offered += 1>><<set $renttime to 7>>
<br><br>

<<if edenFreedomStatus() is 0>>
	Eden nods. <<nnpc_His "Eden">> hand circles your arm. "Let's go home."
<<elseif edenFreedomStatus() is 1>>
	Eden's jaw tightens. <<nnpc_He "Eden">> grabs your arm. "I was worried about you."
<<else>>
	Eden's hand closes on your arm. <<nnpc_His "Eden">> grip is bruising. <<nnpc_His "Eden">> eyes burn into yours. "There you fucking are."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's eyes don't leave yours as Eden drags you away to <<nnpc_his "Eden">> cabin.
<br><br>

<<baileySeenAdd "edenLakeApproach">>
<<link [[Next|Bailey Eden Lake Eden Takes You]]>><</link>>
<br>


