<<effects>><<pass 5>>
<<person1>>

You sit on the log next to Bailey. The bark is warm to the touch.
<br><br>

Bailey casts <<his>> line. You watch the lotus flowers part around it.
<br><br>

<<if $bailey_lure_received>>
	The snake lure breaks the surface. You watch it sink.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<He>> doesn't talk. The water laps at the shore.
<br><br>

<<He>> reels in a fish with ease. <<He>> barely looks at it before unhooking it and tossing it back into the lake.
<br><br>

Without looking at you, <<he>> holds <<his>> fishing rod out.
