:: Bailey Eden Lake Take Rod
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You take the rod. It's heavier than you expected.
<br><br>

"Cast it out. Over there." <<He>> nods towards a gap between the lotus pads.
<br><br>

You pull the rod back and swing it forward. The line lands in the water with a loud slap.
<br><br>

"Too hard." <<He>> takes your hand and adjusts your grip. <<His>> fingers are rough. "Again."<<if $player.virginity.handholding is true>><<if $stockholm_bailey gte 1>> <span class="lewd">You feel elated holding Bailey's hand for the first time.</span><<arousal 500>><<garousal>><<else>> <span class="red">You feel mortified holding Bailey's hand for the first time.</span><<stress 40>><<ggstress>><</if>><<takeNPCVirginity "Bailey" "handholding" "pc">><<takeVirginity "Bailey" "handholding">><</if>><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<arousal 100>>
<br><br>

You cast again with <<his>> guidance. The line arcs out and lands softly between the lotuses.
<br><br>

Bailey lets go of your wrist. <<He>> leans back on the log, eyeing the water.
<br><br>

You wait. The water is still. Minutes pass. Then, the line pulls.
<br><br>

"Slow."
<br><br>

<<link [[Reel slowly|Bailey Eden Lake Reel Slowly]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 700>>
<br>
<<link [[Pull hard|Bailey Eden Lake Pull Hard]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 1200>>
<br>


:: Bailey Eden Lake Reel Slowly
