	<br><br>

	Bailey glances at it. "Not bad."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> picks up the fish, unhooks it, and tosses it back into the lake.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
